You can cast a few spells with a valkyrie if you're not wearing armor
that conflicts with spellcasting, but unreliably. Once you have a robe
and Basic proficiency you can cast basic attack spells (probably most
notably magic missile). The spell of jumping is nice, and the spell of
speed may get you out of some trouble in theory. But then the preference
are speed boots anyway. The very few Spell Power points that a valkyrie
has is what additionally limits the usefulness of spells for that class.
(See also http://nh.gridbug.de/spells.html for a spell calculator.)

